🚗 MechAI – AI-Powered Car Mechanic Chatbot

MechAI is an intelligent automobile troubleshooting chatbot designed to help car owners, enthusiasts, and technicians diagnose vehicle issues quickly and accurately. It uses Large Language Models (LLMs) combined with Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to provide reliable, domain-specific automotive solutions.

🚀 Project Overview

MechAI answers vehicle-related problems such as engine issues, warning lights, braking problems, and maintenance queries. Instead of generic AI responses, it retrieves relevant automotive knowledge from a curated dataset and generates precise, context-aware answers.

The chatbot can also provide top YouTube repair references and is designed to be scalable for real-world automotive assistance.

🎯 Key Objectives

Provide instant vehicle troubleshooting assistance

Reduce dependency on manual diagnosis

Deliver accurate, automotive-specific answers

Improve user understanding of car problems

Assist users before visiting a mechanic

🛠️ Tech Stack
Frontend

React.js

JavaScript, HTML, CSS

Backend

Python (Flask / FastAPI)

REST APIs

AI & NLP

LLaMA 3 (via Groq API)

Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)

Hugging Face Embeddings

LlamaIndex

Vector Database

Pinecone (Automotive knowledge storage)

External APIs

YouTube Data API (repair video references)

⚙️ How MechAI Works

User asks a vehicle-related question

Query is embedded using NLP embeddings

Relevant automotive data is retrieved from Pinecone

LLaMA 3 generates a context-aware response

Chatbot returns concise technical guidance

Optionally provides top YouTube repair references

✨ Features

AI-based car problem diagnosis

Automotive-only response filtering

RAG-based accurate answers

YouTube repair video suggestions

Fast and lightweight chatbot interface

Scalable backend architecture
